The attribution may be included in the project's documentation, source code,
About page, credits section, or another reasonable location that is clearly
visible to users of the Software.

## 3. Modified Versions

You are permitted to modify the Software and distribute modified versions.

Modified versions must:

1. Clearly indicate that modifications have been made;
2. Preserve the original Arkium attribution;
3. Not falsely represent the modified version as the official, unmodified
   Arkium project;
4. Preserve this license or an equivalent attribution requirement.

Example:

> Based on Arkium AI, originally developed by <SEU_NOME>.
> This version contains modifications by <MODIFIER_NAME>.

